<title>NEW ZEALAND: Guinness Peat boosts annual profit.</title>
<headline>Guinness Peat boosts annual profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (million pounds unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   19.14 vs 14.71</p>
<p>    Div (pence)			   0.25 vs same</p>
<p>    Pay date May 19</p>
<p>    Reg date April 11</p>
<p>    Ex div   April 14</p>
<p>Note - Guinness Peat Group is an investment company listed on the London and New Zealand stock exchanges.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
